{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Objective</h2>Each character has a unique profession, equipped with a quirky weapon and special moves that match their profession. Create your own team and watch them battle it out in a physics arena where chaos reigns.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sandbox</h2>Create your desired team with 30 professions: President with embargo and atomic bomb, Housewife with vacuum cleaner, Chef with frying pan, Farmer with cow, Flying tank driver, DJ with loudspeaker, Coffin dancer with dancing, Street singer, Policeman, Doctor... each character has a quirky weapon. Then press &quot;PLAY&quot; and let the simulator take over. Watch the characters sway, bounce and collide - no two matches are exactly the same.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2>30 Exotic Professions with unique weapons, passives, and styles<br>Free-form sandbox mode to let your imagination run wild<br>Endless Team Combination: Combine professions to explore interactions and hilarious disasters<br>Multiple Arenas: From office farming to festival-themed chaos<br><br>Local &amp; Online Battles: Challenge random friends or enemies for bragging rights<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHY YOU'LL LOVE IT</h2>Fun gameplay: hilarious clashes, unique characters with unique attack styles, sloppy tactics, and &quot;what just happened?!&quot; moments<br><br>The game is built to be shared: every match is a viral clip waiting to be broadcast","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3671980?t=1757038217","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3671980?t=1757038217","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671980/cc00d1c35ebc13bbf7a260d35b8dc61e96cfeab0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757038217","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671980/cc00d1c35ebc13bbf7a260d35b8dc61e96cfeab0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757038217","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3772850,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Objective</h2>Each character has a unique profession, equipped with a quirky weapon and special moves that match their profession. Create your own team and watch them battle it out in a physics arena where chaos reigns.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sandbox</h2>Create your desired team with 30 professions: President with embargo and atomic bomb, Housewife with vacuum cleaner, Chef with frying pan, Farmer with cow, Flying tank driver, DJ with loudspeaker, Coffin dancer with dancing, Street singer, Policeman, Doctor... each character has a quirky weapon. Then press &quot;PLAY&quot; and let the simulator take over. Watch the characters sway, bounce and collide - no two matches are exactly the same.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2>30 Exotic Professions with unique weapons, passives, and styles<br>Free-form sandbox mode to let your imagination run wild<br>Endless Team Combination: Combine professions to explore interactions and hilarious disasters<br>Multiple Arenas: From office farming to festival-themed chaos<br><br>Local &amp; Online Battles: Challenge random friends or enemies for bragging rights<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHY YOU'LL LOVE IT</h2>Fun gameplay: hilarious clashes, unique characters with unique attack styles, sloppy tactics, and &quot;what just happened?!&quot; moments<br><br>The game is built to be shared: every match is a viral clip waiting to be broadcast","developers":["Weird Game"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic